zh='''1. **唯一优先候选：热字段列＋既有 ROW remainder，完成真实转换及变更生命周期。** 实验 13／39 已完成的读取、字段分派、冷热合并、拆块／目录搬迁、同批大值及整列降级准备与证据统一见[存储规范](native-single-file-storage-plan)，不计作公开转换验收。剩余工作只围绕同一 Native 协调器：补齐其余既有 schema 组合，并在同一发布中安装 cold binding／GroupDirectory、data／manifest／content-index 和描述符，保留 data-before-root、原源 fence 和退款；接入待提交新 owner／liveness、删除、属性清空、最后组清理与逆转换，使 Entity Map、字段、索引／约束和实际 LargeValue 引用原子一致。把已有整列降级计划与这些路径一并验收，不能遗漏未被用户直接修改的列成员。随后只用实际公开转换后的数据验证完整 integrity、回收、旧 pin、重开、搬迁／退役、故障／退款和真实查询。完成前保持新模式生产发布关闭。保留实际 Entity／竞争普通 ROW 检查及全部字段类型；冷字段只重打包受影响块，整列降级须按原热集合认证本组已有冷根目录，防止旧非法字段因权限变化被洗白。不增建 OwnerMap／ExtensionDirectory、标签索引、缓存或 backend，不扩展 WAL／向量，不提高 64-owner／4096-membership 转换／8 组／1 MiB 边界。'''
en='''1. **One priority candidate: hot columns plus existing ROW remainder; finish actual conversion and mutation lifecycle.** Completed experimental13/39 reading, field dispatch, hot/cold merges, splitting/directory relocation, batch-local values and whole-column demotion preparation/evidence are centralized in the [storage specification](native-single-file-storage-plan), not public-conversion acceptance. Remaining work stays within the same Native coordinator: cover the other existing schema combinations and atomically install cold bindings/GroupDirectory, data/manifests/content index and descriptor, preserving data-before-root, original source fences and refunds; integrate pending-owner/liveness, deletion, empty properties, final-group cleanup and inverse conversion so Entity Map, fields, indexes/constraints and actual LargeValue references remain atomic. Accept existing whole-column demotion plans with those paths without omitting members not directly modified by the user. Then verify full integrity, reclamation, old pins, reopen, relocation/retirement, faults/refunds and real queries on actual publicly converted data. Keep new-mode production publication closed until complete. Preserve actual Entity/competing ordinary-ROW checks and all types. Repack affected cold blocks only; whole-column demotion must authenticate this group's existing cold directories against the original hot set so an old forbidden field cannot become valid through an authority change. Add no OwnerMap/ExtensionDirectory, label index, cache or backend; expand neither WAL/vector scope nor64owner/4096membership conversion/8group/1MiB bounds.'''
for lang,text in [('zh',zh),('en',en)]:
 p=r/lang/'zyx/architecture/optimization.mdx';s=p.read_text();a=s.index('1. **',s.index('20261022-core-cost-layout-scale/'));b=s.index('\n2. **',a);s=s[:a]+text+s[b:];p.write_text(s)
notes={
'zh':'''整列降级的原 Native 准备路径见 `20261023-core-cost-cold-global-demotion/`。ColumnDelta 的显式准备选项只输出不可变完整列计划；默认调用、owner liveness 和生产发布 guard 不放开。原协调器先合并同列全部用户变更，再按最终列状态决定保留或降级。降级时把实际原／最终成员并集中的 owner 合并进最终冷根，保留其他冷字段、NULL／缺失、原 ID 与 Node／Edge 命名空间；不存在的空根不伪造删除。删除列记录／membership 和重写冷根位于同一个私有 MetadataWriteBatch，仍由既有目录、大值与物理分配规划消费，不生成 OwnerMap／EXT。

所有最终非缺失列成员必须有目标根；目标根中的每个降级字段与原完整列计划逐项比较 canonical 值，而不只检查 token／数量。同批未发布整根载体仍用原 immutable holder 认证，不读取未发布 manifest。整列权限变化会影响本组所有冷目录，所以按原始热 token 集认证本组现有冷根，包括不重打包的冷块；原 block generation、实际 Entity／普通 ROW／legacy selector 和 manifest 检查不变。此步骤只扫描本组最多 64-owner 的目录，不扫描数据库，也不把其他冷块重写。去掉这项认证的单对象对照会放过分离在未重打包冷块中的旧非法热字段；当前源码拒绝，原对照报告单独保留。

64-owner、64 用户 replacement、最多 64 个列计划、4096 个实际迁移 membership 和 1 MiB 额度不变；结构列计划与输出冷根可指同一 owner，不重复计作第 65 个 owner。非整列降级调用仍保留原冷热合计 64-change 检查。36 项定向测试验证全部 64 个 owner 的实际值／NULL／原冷字段、遗漏 owner／字段及错值拒绝、同列 17 次删除合并后的阈值降级、缺失成员异类型插入、8193 字节同批大值、清空全部热字段后保留存活无属性组，以及真实 Edge namespace。实验两种 membership 各 514 项相关模块、默认 154 项通过。文件／根／I/O epoch／公开计数器不变、账户退款，公开 guard 保留。原子物理安装、新 owner／删除／liveness／最后组清理／逆转换、其余 schema 组合、完整空间和公开生命周期仍未完成；P7／进度仍为 90%，无全量单测／性能矩阵／提交／推送。''',
'en':'''Original Native whole-column demotion preparation: `20261023-core-cost-cold-global-demotion/`. ColumnDelta's explicit preparation option exposes immutable full-column plans only; default calls, owner liveness and public publication guards remain closed. Original coordination merges all user changes to each column before its final threshold/type decision. Demotion merges original/final actual members into complete cold roots, preserving other cold fields, NULL/missing, original IDs and Node/Edge namespaces; absent empty roots are not fabricated deletions. Column-record/membership removal and cold-root repacking share one private MetadataWriteBatch and existing directory/value/physical placement planning, without OwnerMap/EXT.

Every final nonmissing column member requires a target root; every demoted field is compared against the full original plan's canonical value, not just token/count. Unpublished whole-root carriers retain original immutable-holder proof and no unpublished-manifest read. Global authority changes affect all cold directories in this group, so authenticate existing cold roots against the ORIGINAL hot-token set, including unrepacked blocks. Original block-generation, actual Entity/ordinary-ROW/legacy-selector and manifest checks remain. This visits at most64owners in one group, not the database, and does not rewrite unrelated cold blocks. A single-object control omitting this authentication accepts an old forbidden hot token in a separate unrepacked cold block; current source refuses. Deliberate control failures are retained separately.

64owners,64 user replacements, at most64 column plans,4096 actual emitted memberships and1MiB remain unchanged. Structural plans and cold roots may describe the same owner; they are not an extra65th owner. Non-demotion calls retain their original combined64change check.36 targeted cases cover all64 actual values/NULL/old cold fields; omitted owner/field and wrong-value rejection; merged17-removal threshold demotion; incompatible missing-member insertion; actual8193-byte carriers; retaining live propertyless groups after removing every hot field; and actual Edge namespace. Both experimental membership variants pass514 related module cases, default154. Files/roots/I/O epoch/public counters stay unchanged, accounts refund and public guards remain. Atomic physical installation, new-owner/deletion/liveness/final-group/inverse, other schema combinations, whole-space and public lifecycle remain open; P7/progress90%, no full suite/performance matrix/commit/push.'''}
